cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SPECTRA, please cite both the software and the software paper."
title: "SPECTRA: Spatiotemporal Personal Exposure Characterization and TRAjectory Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  An R toolkit that converts a raw wearable record, one position and one
  concentration per minute, into a dwell-weighted, microenvironment-resolved
  exposure estimate for each person, day and 100 m cell.
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hbnyoni/spectra"
keywords:
  - personal exposure
  - PM2.5
  - trajectory segmentation
  - dwell-time weighting
  - building footprints
  - R
